51 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/Rect[38.15808 130.1547 574.6739 572.92]/F 4/P 63 0 R/FT/Tx/T(txtAddSchedule)/Ff 8392704/V(Multiple Listing Service \(MLS\) Listing\n \nThe Seller acknowledges having received and been explained the RECO Information Guide.\n \nIt is understood that Faris Team Real Estate Brokerage will deliver the Best Experience Guaranteed services which at any time the Seller feels Faris Team Real Estate Brokerage is not meeting expectations, can cancel their listing agreement prior to accepting an offer to purchase your home, with no penalties or obligations.\n\nThe Seller acknowledges that a Buyer may choose to be a Self Represented Party meaning they choose to represent themselves in the purchase of the subject property. The Seller acknowledges that the total commission payable remains the same with no change in this scenario.\n \nThe Seller acknowledges and consents that a lock box can be installed on the property which will contain key\(s\) for access to the property. Access to the lock box will be given as per the Sellers instructions and maintained in the brokerage's showing scheduling software.\n \nFaris Team Real Estate Brokerage agrees to provide the following services to the Seller, where applicable, based on the type of property and Sellers needs for that service.\n \nThey are as follows:\n- MLS Toronto and ITSO Board Exposure\n- Home Staging Consultation\n- Photography\n- Video Tour \n- Drone Photography\n- Feature Books\n- Signage\n- Open House\n- Website and Online Presence\n- Client care and communication\n- Negotiation of Offer\(s\)\n- Documentation Administration)/DA(/6f6fa544-88ee-4cee-8346-5b40a056fe7e 9 Tf 0.003922 0.003922 0.003922 rg\r\n)/MaxLen 5000/MK<</BG[1 1 1]>>/AP<</N 144 0 R>>>>
